    "turn_idx": 0,
    "turn_text": "Gordon Byrd here with Beyond the News from the News Radio WFLA Newsroom, a US House Task Force investigating the two attempts on the life of former President Donald Trump, July 13 in Butler, Pennsylvania, and mid-September, September 15 in West Palm Beach is holding its first meeting Thursday, starting at 930 in Washington in the morning, of course. One of the members of that task force is US Representative Laurel Lee, whose district runs roughly I-75 through East Hillsboro County into the Kathleen and Lakeland areas in Polk County. Certainly one of the Bay Area delegation. Representative Lee, thank you very much for joining us on Beyond the News.",
