  {
    "episode_id": 84194,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84194.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "And indeed, one of your fellow task force members, Representative Mike Waltz, who's also part of the Florida delegation, has said that while the Secret Service has been forthcoming, in his estimation, the FBI hasn't been as much so. How confident are you? What do you believe you would like to see from the FBI going forward on these attempts?",
