        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts Representative Mike Waltz’s judgment regarding inter-agency behavior.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The addressee has relevant insight into FBI operations or performance.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Transparency from law enforcement agencies is a desirable standard.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the FBI's lack of forthrightness as a significant concern.",
